(text "One of 64 identical current cells (bom 1.2 + 2). Analog values from bfdac_cosim112.cir; base-drive network re-sized 2026-09-26 for the locked-deck levels 1.10/1.70 V (rs 1.35k, rp 301 to VCM 1.345 V). D arrives at 3.3 V from the XLAT sheet (SN74AXC8T245 octal, 8/channel; the per-cell AXC1T45 was removed 2026-10-10)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 17.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a08d71b1-3b0b-4923-b3b7-3d11df336e38"))
(text "DMMT5551 = one dual package per cell (units A/B); the tail NPN is 1/4 of a THAT300 (Q301..Q316, unit = cell mod 4, substrate pins on CORE). Footprints/MPNs: parts pass 2026-09-28 (MPN field)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 21.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "08e46c8f-c8c5-4c8e-acab-d4ebce25454f"))
